action-gene-telekinesis-name = Telekinesis
action-gene-telekinesis-desc = Hurl the targeted object or creature away with your mind.

action-gene-pyrokinesis-name = Pyrokinesis
action-gene-pyrokinesis-desc = Set the targeted creature or object ablaze.

mutation-night-eyes-name = Night Eyes
mutation-night-eyes-desc = The carrier's eyes drink in the faintest light, granting sight in the dark.

mutation-iron-retina-name = Iron Retina
mutation-iron-retina-desc = Hardened retinas render the carrier immune to flashes.

mutation-clumsiness-name = Clumsiness
mutation-clumsiness-desc = A degenerate motor gene that makes the carrier fumble and hurt themselves.

mutation-mutism-name = Mutism
mutation-mutism-desc = A defective speech gene that robs the carrier of their voice.

mutation-pacifism-name = Pacifism
mutation-pacifism-desc = A pacifying gene that leaves the carrier unable to bring themselves to harm anyone.

mutation-sure-footed-name = Sure-Footed
mutation-sure-footed-desc = An adaptive gait that keeps the carrier from slipping on any surface.

mutation-shock-immunity-name = Insulated Skin
mutation-shock-immunity-desc = The carrier's flesh resists electrical current, shrugging off shocks.

mutation-thermal-resistance-name = Thermal Regulation
mutation-thermal-resistance-desc = The carrier's body holds a steady temperature, ignoring searing heat and biting cold.

mutation-glow-name = Luminescence
mutation-glow-desc = The carrier's skin glows with a soft inner light, illuminating their surroundings.

mutation-fleet-footed-name = Fleet-Footed
mutation-fleet-footed-desc = Rewired muscle fibers let the carrier move noticeably faster.

mutation-regeneration-name = Regeneration
mutation-regeneration-desc = An accelerated healing gene that slowly knits the carrier's wounds back together.

mutation-blindness-name = Blindness
mutation-blindness-desc = A defective optic gene that leaves the carrier permanently blind.

mutation-radioactive-name = Radioactivity
mutation-radioactive-desc = An unstable gene that turns the carrier into a slow-burning radiation source.

mutation-telekinesis-name = Telekinesis
mutation-telekinesis-desc = The carrier's mind can grasp and hurl distant objects through sheer will.

mutation-pyrokinesis-name = Pyrokinesis
mutation-pyrokinesis-desc = The carrier can set distant targets ablaze with a focused thought.

mutation-cryokinesis-name = Cryogenesis
mutation-cryokinesis-desc = The carrier's flesh runs cold and dense, shrugging off freezing temperatures and the crush of vacuum.

mutation-gigantism-name = Gigantism
mutation-gigantism-desc = An overactive growth gene that swells the carrier to towering proportions.

mutation-dwarfism-name = Dwarfism
mutation-dwarfism-desc = A stunted growth gene that shrinks the carrier to a diminutive size.

mutation-fire-resistance-name = Fire Resistance
mutation-fire-resistance-desc = Toughened flesh shrugs off searing heat and flame, though the cold still bites.

mutation-chameleon-skin-name = Chameleon Skin
mutation-chameleon-skin-desc = The carrier's skin shifts to match their surroundings, making them harder to spot.

mutation-mind-shield-name = Psychic Resistance
mutation-mind-shield-desc = A fortified mind that resists conversion, coercion, and other psychic intrusion.
